    "If the ble is not connecting, remove the old pairing from Bluetooth Settings and pair Ble again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wenn BLE keine Verbindung herstellt, entferne die alte Kopplung in den Bluetooth-Einstellungen und kopple BLE erneut."
          }
        },
        "el": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Εάν το BLE δεν συνδέεται, καταργήστε την παλιά σύζευξη από τις Ρυθμίσεις Bluetooth και συνδέστε ξανά το BLE."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Si el BLE no se conecta, elimina el emparejamiento anterior en Ajustes de Bluetooth y conéctalo de nuevo."
          }
        },
        "fi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Jos BLE ei yhdistä, poista vanha laitepari Bluetooth-asetuksista ja muodosta BLE-laitepari uudelleen."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Se il BLE non si connette, rimuovi la precedente associazione nelle Impostazioni Bluetooth e associa nuovamente il BLE."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If the Bluetooth connection is not established correctly or gets stuck scanning, the official Tinkerride (Thinkerride) app might be taking or holding the connection.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wenn die Bluetooth-Verbindung nicht ordnungsgemäß hergestellt wird oder beim Scannen hängen bleibt, hält möglicherweise die offizielle Tinkerride (Thinkerride)-App die Verbindung besetzt."
          }
        },
        "el": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Εάν η σύνδεση Bluetooth δεν πραγματοποιείται σωστά ή κολλάει στη σάρωση, η επίσημη εφαρμογή Tinkerride (Thinkerride) ενδέχεται να καταλαμβάνει τη σύνδεση."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Si la conexión Bluetooth no se establece correctamente o se queda escaneando, la app oficial Tinkerride (Thinkerride) podría estar bloqueando la conexión."
          }
        },
        "fi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Jos Bluetooth-yhteys ei muodostu kunnolla tai skannaus jumiutuu, virallinen Tinkerride (Thinkerride) -sovellus saattaa varata yhteyden."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Se la connessione Bluetooth non viene stabilita correttamente o rimane bloccata durante la scansione, l'app ufficiale Tinkerride (Thinkerride) potrebbe occupare la connessione."
          }
        }
      }
    },
